{"id":10067,"name":"altaria-mega","speciesId":334,"dex":334,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["dragon","fairy"],"stats":{"hp":75,"attack":110,"defense":110,"special-attack":110,"special-defense":105,"speed":80},"abilities":[{"name":"pixilate","hidden":false}],"height":15,"weight":206,"baseExp":207,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10067.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10067.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10067.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10067.ogg","genus":"Humming Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"ALTARIA dances and wheels through the sky among billowing, cotton-like clouds. By singing melodies in its crystal-clear voice, this POKéMON makes its listeners experience dreamy wonderment."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"ALTARIA sings in a gorgeous soprano. Its wings are like cotton clouds. This POKéMON catches updrafts with its buoyant wings and soars way up into the wild blue yonder."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It hums in a beautiful soprano voice. It flies among white clouds in the blue sky. It launches intensely hot fireballs from its mouth."},{"version":"firered","text":"If you hear a beautiful melody trilling deep among mountains far from people, it is ALTARIA’s humming."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It looks like a fluffy cloud when it is in flight. It hums with its soprano voice."},{"version":"platinum","text":"If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It flies gracefully through the sky. Its melodic humming makes you feel like you’re in a dream."},{"version":"black-2","text":"On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano."},{"